<title>QATAR: QUASH-JANSHER BEATS EYLES IN QATAR INTERNATIONAL FINAL.</title>
<headline>QUASH-JANSHER BEATS EYLES IN QATAR INTERNATIONAL FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in the Qatar</p>
<p>international squash tournament on Thursday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat 2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) 15-10</p>
<p>15-7 13-15 15-10</p>
